OL,3,CCPS decision not to charge Letby over
OL,4,Csix more babies upheld
OL,6,FFamilies of six more babies said to
OL,7,Fhave been harmed by serial killer
OL,8,Fnurse Lucy Letby have failed in their
OL,9,Fbid to overturn a decision not to
OL,10,Fprosecute her further.
OL,12,FThe Crown Prosecution Service (CPS)
OL,13,Fruled in January 2026 that no new
OL,14,Fcriminal charges would be brought
OL,15,Fagainst Letby over potential offences
OL,16,Fof attempted murder and murder
OL,17,Finvolving nine children, including two
OL,18,Fwho died, as the "evidential test was
OL,19,Fnot met".
OL,26,@zD@ROU{D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
