OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785932297
OL,3,CCPS decision not to charge Letby over
OL,4,Csix more babies upheld
OL,6,FCheshire Constabulary had passed a
OL,7,Ffile of evidence to the CPS asking to
OL,8,Fconsider the allegations following a
OL,9,Freview of deaths and non-fatal
OL,10,Fcollapses of babies during Letby's
OL,11,Ftime at the Countess of Chester
OL,12,FHospital, and also Liverpool Women's
OL,13,FHospital where she trained, from 2012
OL,14,Fto 2016.
OL,16,FSix families requested a review of the
OL,17,FCPS's decisions involving their child
OL,18,Fas part of the Victims' Right to
OL,19,FReview scheme.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
