OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785932297
OL,3,CCPS decision not to charge Letby over
OL,4,Csix more babies upheld
OL,6,FAn "extensive" review by an
OL,7,Findependent prosecutor followed which
OL,8,Fupheld the ruling not to bring further
OL,9,Fcharges, said the CPS.
OL,11,FMalcolm McHaffie, head of the CPS's
OL,12,Fspecial crime division said: "In
OL,13,FJanuary 2026, after reviewing a file
OL,14,Fof evidence from Cheshire
OL,15,FConstabulary, we decided that no
OL,16,Ffurther criminal charges should be
OL,17,Fbrought against Lucy Letby, 36,
OL,18,Frelating to deaths and non-fatal
OL,19,Fcollapses of babies at the Countess of
OL,20,FChester Hospital and Liverpool Women's
OL,21,FHospital.
OL,26,@nD@DOUnD@NO]tD@^OU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
