CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785932297
OL,3,CCPS decision not to charge Letby over
OL,4,Csix more babies upheld
OL,6,F"The Crown Prosecution Service
OL,7,Fsubsequently received requests in
OL,8,Frelation to six infants for the
OL,9,Fdecisions to be reviewed under the
OL,10,FVictims' Right to Review (VRR) scheme.
OL,12,F"An extensive review of the case by a
OL,13,Fprosecutor independent of the original
OL,14,Fdecisions, involving a re-examination
OL,15,Fof substantial evidence and material,
OL,16,Fhas now been completed.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785932297
OL,3,CCPS decision not to charge Letby over
OL,4,Csix more babies upheld
OL,6,F"Six offences of attempted murder were
OL,7,Freconsidered in relation to six
OL,8,Fbabies, but the review upheld the
OL,9,Foriginal decision not to bring any
OL,10,Ffurther criminal charges.
OL,12,F"The Crown Prosecution Service has
OL,13,Fwritten to the families involved and
OL,14,Fwill offer meetings to answer any
OL,15,Ffurther questions. Our thoughts remain
OL,16,Fwith them."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUxD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
