PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785932297
OL,3,CCPS decision not to charge Letby over
OL,4,Csix more babies upheld
OL,6,FLetby, from Hereford, is serving 15
OL,7,Fwhole life terms for the murders of
OL,8,Fseven babies and attempting to kill
OL,9,Fseven more at the Countess of Chester
OL,10,FHospital's neonatal unit between June
OL,11,F2015 and June 2016.
OL,13,FThe 36-year-old was twice denied
OL,14,Fpermission to appeal against her
OL,15,Fconvictions in 2024.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
