FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1785932297
OL,3,CCPS decision not to charge Letby over
OL,4,Csix more babies upheld
OL,6,FThe Criminal Cases Review Commission,
OL,7,Fwhich investigates potential
OL,8,Fmiscarriages of justice, is
OL,9,Fconsidering evidence presented on her
OL,10,Fbehalf by an international panel of
OL,11,Fmedics who claim poor medical care and
OL,12,Fnatural causes were the reasons for
OL,13,Fthe babies collapsing.
OL,15,FA public inquiry, led by Lady Justice
OL,16,FThirlwall, into how the neonatal nurse
OL,17,Fwas able to commit her crimes is due
OL,18,Fto publish its findings later this
OL,19,Fyear, on a date yet to be announced.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
